# asset-curator-journal

Append-only findings log for `feat/asset-curator`. Each entry is
written when a worker (sub-agent or human) finishes a task. The
parent reads this on resume to know what's been discovered.

Format per entry:
```
## YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ · task-id · status · worker

<one-paragraph summary>

<artifacts written>

<open questions / drift-tuning notes>
```

